flowchart TB
    %% Part 1 — evidence-based DaPlanStan architecture, intended baseline only.
    %% Functional groups below are for readability; they are NOT formal architectural layers.

    Browser[User / Browser]
    ForwardedEmail[Travel email sender]

    subgraph Web[Routes, controllers, and frontend]
        Routes[config/routes.rb]
        TripsC[TripsController]
        InboxC[InboxItemsController]
        SessionsC[SessionsController]
        NotifC[NotificationsController]
        Views[Rails ERB views / Turbo frontend]
    end

    subgraph Models[Application models and model concern]
        Trip[Trip]
        Member[TripMember]
        Inbox[InboxItem]
        Item[TripItem]
        Expense[Expense]
        Identity[User / UserIdentity]
        GeoConcern[Geocodable concern]
    end

    subgraph Background[Application background jobs]
        CoverJob[FetchTripCoverImageJob]
        ParseJob[ParseInboxItemJob]
        GeoJob[GeocodeTripItemsJob]
        ReceiptJob[ParseReceiptJob]
    end

    subgraph Email[Inbound and outbound email components]
        ActionMailbox[Action Mailbox / Postmark ingress]
        TripMailbox[TripMailbox]
        Mailers[TripMailer / InvitationMailer]
    end

    subgraph External[External providers and supporting libraries]
        Anthropic[Anthropic API]
        Pexels[Pexels API]
        Geocoder[Geocoder library]
        Nominatim[Nominatim]
        OAuth[Google / Apple via OmniAuth]
        Map[Leaflet + OSM / CARTO map resources]
        Postmark[Postmark email service]
    end

    DB[(SQLite / Active Record persistence)]

    %% HTTP, trip creation, and browsing
    Browser -->|HTTP requests| Routes
    Routes -->|trip actions| TripsC
    Routes -->|inbox review actions| InboxC
    Routes -->|notifications| NotifC
    TripsC -->|create / manage trip| Trip
    TripsC -->|create owner membership| Member
    Trip -->|save / query| DB
    Member -->|save / query| DB
    TripsC -->|enqueue cover-image lookup| CoverJob
    CoverJob -->|search cover images| Pexels
    Pexels -->|image result| CoverJob
    CoverJob -->|update trip cover information| Trip
    TripsC -->|render / redirect| Views
    Views -->|HTML / Turbo UI| Browser
    Views -->|display map| Map

    %% Inbound email and subsequent, separately triggered domain linking
    ForwardedEmail -->|send message| Postmark
    Postmark -->|inbound delivery| ActionMailbox
    ActionMailbox -->|route inbound email| TripMailbox
    TripMailbox -->|create record; check sender| Inbox
    Inbox -->|save email and states| DB
    TripMailbox -->|approved sender: enqueue| ParseJob
    TripMailbox -->|unapproved sender notice| Mailers
    ParseJob -->|structured extraction request| Anthropic
    Anthropic -->|parsed response| ParseJob
    ParseJob -->|save parsed data / status| Inbox
    InboxC -->|review / confirm when applicable| Inbox
    Inbox -->|fill_missing_links!: create / link itinerary| Item
    Inbox -->|fill_missing_links!: create / link expense| Expense
    Item -->|save / query| DB
    Expense -->|save / query| DB
    NotifC -->|query pending sender / review status| Inbox
    NotifC -->|render notifications page| Views

    %% Geocoding: route/controller work is synchronous; job/API work is async
    TripsC -->|geocode_missing: enqueue| GeoJob
    GeoJob -->|geocode_from_address| Item
    Item -->|include / invoke concern behavior| GeoConcern
    GeoConcern -->|geocoding lookup| Geocoder
    Geocoder -->|configured lookup provider| Nominatim
    Nominatim -->|coordinates response| Geocoder
    GeoConcern -->|latitude / longitude result| Item
    GeoJob -->|Turbo refresh broadcast| Views

    %% Other confirmed integrations
    ReceiptJob -->|receipt parsing request| Anthropic
    Browser -->|sign in| OAuth
    OAuth -->|callback /auth/:provider/callback| Routes
    Routes -->|sessions#create| SessionsC
    SessionsC -->|find / create provider identity| Identity
    Identity -->|save / query| DB
    Mailers -->|outbound delivery| Postmark
